  "date": "2026-08-25",
  "text": "Today, I am proud to have completed the Level 5 Advanced Diploma in Financial Trading, accredited by VTCT and externally recognised by CISI at Associate Membership level.\n\nWhen I joined the programme through ZISHI at Sheffield Hallam University, I had very little knowledge of trading or financial markets. Over the past five weeks, I've learned far more than I expected, not only about trading but about the mindset required to succeed in the industry.\n\nThe biggest lesson I've taken away is that trading is not about chasing profits. It's about preparation, discipline, managing risk, controlling emotions under pressure, and consistently following a well-thought-out process.\n\nThis programme has taught me the importance of planning, resilience, attention to detail, and making decisions when it matters most. It has also given me a genuine appreciation for the knowledge, professionalism, and behavioural traits required for a sustainable career in financial markets.\n\nBeyond the technical skills, I'm grateful for the friendships formed along the way. Being surrounded by ambitious, supportive, and driven individuals created an environment that pushed me to grow every day. The experience has strengthened my confidence, emotional intelligence, and enthusiasm for pursuing a career in the industry.\n\nA huge thank you to Alex Wilson, David Michael, Jon Harman and Robert Russell for their guidance, mentorship, and willingness to share their knowledge and experience.\n\nThank you to ZISHI, Sheffield Hallam University, Sheffield Business School, ICE, and Aralyx for creating and supporting such an incredible programme and providing students with access to a professional trading environment.\n\nCompleting this qualification is something I'm genuinely proud of, but more importantly, it feels like the beginning rather than the end.\n\nFive weeks ago, I knew almost nothing about trading.\nToday, I leave with new knowledge, new friendships, greater confidence, and an even stronger desire to build a career in financial markets.\n\n#ZISHI #SBS #SheffieldHallamUniversity #ICE #AralyxTrading #VTCT #CISI #Trading #FinancialMarkets #RiskManagement #Discipline #Resilience #WomenInFinance"
