  "date": "2026-08-25",
  "text": "Five weeks of intensive learning, practical trading and personal growth have come to an end.\n\nI’m proud to have completed the Level 5 Advanced Diploma in Financial Trading, delivered by ZISHI at Sheffield Business School, accredited by #VTCT and recognised by The Chartered Institute for Securities & Investment (The CISI) at Associate Membership level.\nThe programme gave me valuable exposure to real-time financial markets. I developed my understanding of morning market briefs, market monitoring, technical analysis, support and resistance, trade timing, risk management and trading diaries.\n\nOne of my biggest lessons is that trading is not only about charts and prices. Market behaviour, human psychology, patience, discipline and emotional control are also important. Sometimes the best decision is to wait, observe and stay humble.\n\nAnother highlight was learning alongside an amazing group of classmates. Everyone brought different strengths and ideas, and I learned a lot through our teamwork and market discussions.\n\nA big thank you to David Michael,Robert Russell,Alex Wilson and Jon Harman for sharing their knowledge, practical experience, guidance and patience throughout the programme. I am also grateful to ZISHI, Sheffield Hallam University, Sheffield Business School, ICE and Aralyx Trading for supporting this opportunity.\n\nThis qualification is an important step in my career development, but I know there is still a lot for me to learn.\n\nMy next step is to continue building on the knowledge and practical experience I gained from the Level 5 program, continue developing my understanding of financial markets, and work towards becoming a confident financial markets practitioner.\n\nThe five-week program has finished, but my learning journey continues.\n\n#ZISHI #VTCT #CISI #SheffieldHallamUniversity #SheffieldBusinessSchool #ICE #AralyxTrading #FinancialTrading #FinancialMarkets #TechnicalAnalysis #RiskManagement #TradingPsychology #MarketAnalysis #ProfessionalDevelopment #CareerGrowth"
