  "text": "Week 5 summary:  \nThis week marked the end of the fifth and final week of the Advanced Level 5 Trading Diploma Programme at the Sheffield Hallam School of Business accredited by #VTCT and recognized by #CISI at \"associate Membership\"level directed by ZISHI.\n\nWhen I first started this course, I did not know what to expect as a novice in this industry. Moreover, as a mechanical engineer student, these 5 weeks have been one of the most interesting and intense weeks I have endured. Prior to joining ZISHI, I had been on many different online trading courses, (FX) that only wanted my capital without teaching me the basis of this industry. ZISHI has taught me subjects that I had never heard before in all these different courses, and it has improved my knowledge and confidence to greater heights. In addition to this, my confidence has not only improved whilst trading, but also with communication with other students as improved.\n\nWhen I was young, I used to believe that I could become rich overnight by trading with no knowledge, sadly this is not true. I was sold a dream from people that trading can make me become rich and fancy in an instant, therefore I needed answers. When I used to trade before this programme, I had absolutely no control over my trades and emotions used to take over constantly. Now I possess an excellent psychological alignment with all my trades as well as resilience, tranquility, knowledge and great-decision making. Furthermore, I have a set routine, in which in-depth planning before the day starts became a necessity for me, in order to see consistency in my trading through the daily dairies. At ZISHI, I have learned topics such as; how derivatives markets operate, macro and micro economic analysis, understanding technical analysis and fundamentals, Bonds and associated risks, operation of commodities markets, Options, Spreads, Outright and so much more.\n\nThe ZISHI course has revealed a new hidden interest that I have been longing for since I started my degree. Furthermore, thanks for Neil Scurlock amazing innovative lesson on week 4 on ICE, I have discovered areas in the workplace that I could thrive in with this great qualification that I have earned. I can confidently say that I have become such a better version of myself as a trader and person compared to 5 weeks ago.\n\nI would like to thank Robert Russell, David Michael, Alex Wilson, Jon Harman and George Lake for the constant support and love of teaching that you have showed in the entirety of the course. Moreover, I would like to thank Neil Scurlock for coming all the way to Sheffield to deliver an incredible lecture on ICE and the vast opportunities available. The days have flown fast, but I can't wait to progress in this industry!! \n#Trading #Finance #ZISHI \n#SHEFFIELD BUSINESS SCHOOL"
